    <string name="onb_intro_1_title">No manual food logging</string>
    <string name="onb_intro_1_body">kCal builds your whole week of meals up front, filtered by your region, your budget, and your health needs. You just follow and check off.</string>
    <string name="onb_intro_2_title">Built for your region</string>
    <string name="onb_intro_2_body">Most diet apps recommend food you can\'t find nearby. kCal builds your weekly plan around what\'s actually available and eaten where you live.</string>
    <string name="onb_intro_3_title">Fits your budget</string>
    <string name="onb_intro_3_body">No more \'ideal\' foods you can\'t afford. kCal swaps in local, budget-friendly options that hit the same nutrition goals.</string>

